# Protected core

## Context

The following files are load-bearing:

- `app/src/store.ts`
- `app/src/types.ts`

`app/src/store.ts` contains the custom dispatch and notification engine.

`app/src/types.ts` contains the core domain types and the `Action` discriminated union.

Changes to these files can affect the entire application.

## Rule

Do not modify `app/src/store.ts` or `app/src/types.ts` without explicit user approval.

If a requested feature appears to require changes to either file, explain why the change is needed and wait for approval before editing.

For normal feature work, prefer changes in:

- `app/src/reducer.ts`
- `app/src/actions.ts`
- `app/src/selectors.ts`
- their colocated tests

Do not refactor, rename, reorganize, or “modernize” protected files as part of unrelated work.

## How to verify

Before completing the task:

- inspect `git diff -- app/src/store.ts app/src/types.ts`;
- confirm `store.ts` and `types.ts` are unchanged unless explicit approval was given;
- report any protected-file modification explicitly.